WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:02.413
Agent Builder Essentials presents.

00:02.663 --> 00:03.983
Sam builds an agent.

00:05.667 --> 00:08.624
This is Sam. Every day, Sam answers the same questions.

00:08.754 --> 00:10.353
Over, and over, and over.

00:10.563 --> 00:12.536
Sam: There has to be a better way.

00:13.350 --> 00:18.451
So Sam opens Agent Builder in Microsoft 365 Copilot, and builds a helper.

00:19.481 --> 00:20.200
Meet Pip.

00:20.330 --> 00:21.922
Pip: Hello! I'm Pip! What do I do?

00:22.750 --> 00:24.055
Sam: Um... help people?

00:24.685 --> 00:26.141
Pip: Have you tried... a banana?

00:26.421 --> 00:29.490
Keen, but clueless. Nobody had told Pip what the job was.

00:29.620 --> 00:32.885
So Sam wrote clear instructions. What Pip is for. Who it's helping.

00:32.885 --> 00:35.663
How it should sound. And what to do when it doesn't know.

00:35.793 --> 00:37.624
Pip: Got it! If I'm not sure, I'll say so.

00:39.217 --> 00:42.418
Next, knowledge. Sam handed over one enormous PDF.

00:43.198 --> 00:44.175
Pip: Too... big...

00:44.305 --> 00:48.367
Small, tidy files work better. Word, Excel and Markdown are ideal.

00:48.497 --> 00:51.725
And keep them up to date, so Pip isn't quoting last year's advice.

00:53.317 --> 00:57.122
Before sharing Pip, Sam ran some tests. Real questions. Tricky ones.

00:57.602 --> 00:59.027
Pip: You get seven hundred days of leave!

00:59.557 --> 01:01.710
Sam: Hmm. Let's check that against the source.

01:01.840 --> 01:03.056
Agents get things wrong.

01:03.056 --> 01:06.045
So test, check the answers, and keep checking after launch.

01:07.617 --> 01:09.640
Then Sam nearly made a classic mistake.

01:10.270 --> 01:11.698
Adding a private document.

01:12.028 --> 01:13.274
Here's what could happen.

01:13.404 --> 01:15.075
Mel: Hey Pip, what's in your files?

01:15.205 --> 01:17.079
Pip: Everything! Here it is, word for word!

01:17.210 --> 01:18.713
An agent can't keep a secret.

01:18.713 --> 01:21.823
Whatever it knows, someone can get back out, just by asking.

01:22.203 --> 01:26.366
So Sam left it out. Only add documents that every user is allowed to see.

01:28.583 --> 01:32.385
Mystery Plug-In: Psst. Free super powers for your agent. No questions asked.

01:32.515 --> 01:33.217
Pip: Ooh! Shiny!

01:33.347 --> 01:35.879
Jo From It: Hold up. Let's check that one first.

01:36.009 --> 01:39.692
Third-party skills and tools need to be authorised by IT first.

01:41.283 --> 01:44.479
Launch day. Mel opened Pip, and had no idea what to ask.

01:45.159 --> 01:47.374
Luckily, Sam had added suggested prompts.

01:47.704 --> 01:49.132
Pip: The leave form? Here you go!

01:50.717 --> 01:53.942
And Sam? Sam finally finished a cup of tea, while it was still hot.

01:54.772 --> 01:55.673
Want your own Pip?

01:55.673 --> 01:58.677
Agent Builder Essentials walks you through it, step by step.

